<div class="question">
  <strong>1.</strong> [19] Which is the largest continent by area?
  <div class="options"><span class="opt">A. Europe</span><span class="opt">B. Africa</span><span class="opt">C. North America</span><span class="opt correct">D. Asia</span></div>
  <div class="answer">Answer: D</div>
</div>

<div class="question">
  <strong>2.</strong> [29] In which year did India gain independence?
  <div class="options"><span class="opt">A. 1945</span><span class="opt correct">B. 1947</span><span class="opt">C. 1950</span><span class="opt">D. 1942</span></div>
  <div class="answer">Answer: B</div>
</div>

<div class="question">
  <strong>3.</strong> [24] Which dynasty is known for Dravidian culture and temple architecture?
  <div class="options"><span class="opt correct">A. Chola</span><span class="opt">B. Pandya</span><span class="opt">C. Pallava</span><span class="opt">D. Chalukya</span></div>
  <div class="answer">Answer: A</div>
</div>

<div class="question">
  <strong>4.</strong> [33] GDP (Gross Domestic Product) measures...
  <div class="options"><span class="opt">A. Population income</span><span class="opt correct">B. Total value of goods and services produced annually</span><span class="opt">C. Inflation rate</span><span class="opt">D. Total wealth of a country</span></div>
  <div class="answer">Answer: B</div>
</div>

<div class="question">
  <strong>5.</strong> [33] Who built the Taj Mahal?
  <div class="options"><span class="opt">A. Akbar</span><span class="opt correct">B. Shah Jahan</span><span class="opt">C. Aurangzeb</span><span class="opt">D. Babar</span></div>
  <div class="answer">Answer: B</div>
</div>

<div class="question">
  <strong>6.</strong> [27] Who built the Taj Mahal?
  <div class="options"><span class="opt">A. Babar</span><span class="opt correct">B. Shah Jahan</span><span class="opt">C. Akbar</span><span class="opt">D. Aurangzeb</span></div>
  <div class="answer">Answer: B</div>
</div>

<div class="question">
